Third-party components
======================

The MIT license in LICENSE covers this repository's own work. The files and
trees listed below are vendored from upstream projects and remain under their
own terms. They are refreshed from upstream rather than edited in place; the
edit policy and refresh instructions live in .claude/rules/vendored-files.md.

Note that this repository is NOT uniformly MIT: the iTerm2 shell integration
script is GPL-2.0-or-later. Anyone reusing files from here should check this
list first.


fzf -- MIT
  https://github.com/junegunn/fzf

    local/bin/fzf-tmux
    config/fzf/completion.bash
    config/fzf/completion.zsh
    config/fzf/key-bindings.bash
    config/fzf/key-bindings.zsh
    config/fzf/key-bindings.fish
    local/man/man1/fzf.1
    local/man/man1/fzf-tmux.1

  The two man pages are shipped by fzf and carry its MIT header inline; they
  are not generated by this repo's own doc pipeline.


iTerm2 shell integration -- GPL-2.0-or-later
  https://iterm2.com/shell_integration/zsh

    local/bin/iterm2_shell_integration.zsh

  The full notice is preserved in the file header. This is the one component
  here whose license is not MIT-compatible in the permissive direction: code
